Z||000009||My7Fieros||12-18-2000||08:15 PM||||Oreif, I used plain Testors model paint. The color matches the interior PERFECTLY, and no it doesnt flake or need touching up. Its not like it gets any kind of wear..the thing doesnt even move. So if someone tells you it peels off their full of sh1t lol. Its the only car Ive done thus far, but Ill no doubt do it on my other non GT cars when I get the gumption.||||reg||1
